# A sweep produces ~7 MB, and 5 MB of that is the raw agent transcript. Every
# number taken from it already lives in record.json (tool calls by name, final
# message, cost, tokens), so the transcript stays local for forensics and out
# of history for weight.
results/*/runs/*/stream.jsonl
results/*/runs/*/cwd/

# The exported STEP files DO stay committed, deliberately: they are the one
# thing a future oracle version cannot reconstruct, and re-grading an old sweep
# with a better oracle is worth 1 MB a run.
